   "setlist": "# BleauLive Theater\r\n@ Spritbox\r\n* Cellar Door\r\n* Jaded\r\n* Angel Eyes\r\n* The Void\r\n* Rule of Nines\r\n* Hurt You\r\n* Yellowjacket\r\n* Circle With Me\r\n* Holy Roller\r\n@ Bring Me the Horizon\r\n* DArkSide\r\n* Empire (Let Them Sing)\r\n* MANTRA\r\n* Teardrops\r\n* AmEN!\r\n* Kool-Aid\r\n* The Best Is Yet to Come\r\n* Shadow Moses\r\n* Obey\r\n* DiE4u\r\n* Itch for the Cure (When Will We Be Free?)\r\n* Kingslayer\r\n* sTraNgeRs (Acoustic)\r\n* Diamonds Aren't Forever\r\n* Parasite Eve\r\n* Antivist (with audience member Sofia)\r\n* Drown\r\n* Can You Feel My Heart\r\n# Encore:\r\n* Doomed\r\n* LosT\r\n* Throne\r\n\r\n# Brooklyn Bowl Las Vegas\r\n@ Nitzer Ebb\r\n* Control I'm Here\r\n* Hearts and Minds\r\n* Blood Money\r\n* For Fun\r\n* Lightning Man\r\n* Captivate\r\n* Once You Say\r\n* Come Alive\r\n* Join in the Chant\r\n* Down on Your Knees\r\n* Let Your Body Learn\r\n* Murderous\r\n# Encore:\r\n* Violent Playground\r\n* I Give to You\r\n@ Front 242\r\n* First In/First Out\r\n* Take One\r\n* Don't Crash\r\n* Funkahdafi\r\n* Generator\r\n* Quite Unusual\r\n* Soul Manager\r\n* Commando Mix\r\n* Red Team\r\n* Deeply Asleep\r\n* Operating Tracks\r\n* Tragedy >For You<\r\n* Fix It\r\n* Headhunter\r\n* W.Y.H.I.W.Y.G. / U-Men\r\n* Moldavia\r\n# Encore:\r\n* No Shuffle\r\n* Welcome to Paradise\r\n\r\n# House of Blues\r\n@ Amira Elfeky\r\n\r\n@ Chevelle\r\n* Verruckt\r\n* An Island\r\n* Door to Door Cannibals\r\n* Self Destructor\r\n* Vitamin R (Leading Us Along)\r\n* Young Wicked\r\n* Take Out the Gunman\r\n* Joyride (Omen)\r\n* Face to the Floor\r\n* The Clincher\r\n* Jars\r\n* Forfeit\r\n* Send the Pain Below\r\n* Piistol Star (Gravity Heals)\r\n* Hats Off to the Bull\r\n* The Red (Solo)\r\n* Comfortable Liar\r\n* I Get It\r\n* Mars Simula",
